<%- include('./partials/header.ejs') %>

    <!-- AI Disclaimer Page -->
    <section class="legal-page ai-disclaimer-page">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="legal-container">
                <div class="legal-header">
                    <h1 class="legal-title fs-32 fw-700">AI Disclaimer</h1>
                    <p class="section-text fs-16">The features in Rubitt that use Artificial Intelligence (AI) are
                        designed to be powerful study aids. They can help you generate notes, create flashcards, and
                        understand complex topics by summarizing lecture material.</p>
                    <p class="section-text fs-16">However, it is important to understand the limitations of this
                        technology.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="legal-content">
                    <!-- Section 1 -->
                    <div class="legal-section">
                        <h2 class="section-title fs-24 fw-700">Accuracy of Information</h2>
                        <p class="section-text fs-16">AI models, while advanced, are not infallible. The content
                            generated by Rubitt's AI features is based on patterns in the data it was trained on and the
                            specific lecture transcript provided. It may sometimes produce information that is
                            incorrect, biased, or outdated.</p>
                        <p class="section-text fs-16"><strong>The AI-generated content should not be considered a
                                substitute for your own understanding, critical thinking, or the original lecture
                                material. Always verify important information and use the AI-generated content as a
                                starting point for your studies, not as the final source of truth.</strong></p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Section 2 -->
                    <div class="legal-section">
                        <h2 class="section-title fs-24 fw-700">Not a Replacement for Professional Advice</h2>
                        <p class="section-text fs-16">Rubitt is a study tool. It is not designed to provide academic,
                            professional, or legal advice. The information generated by the AI should not be interpreted
                            as such.</p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Section 3 -->
                    <div class="legal-section">
                        <h2 class="section-title fs-24 fw-700">Your Responsibility</h2>
                        <p class="section-text fs-16">You are responsible for the academic work you submit. While Rubitt
                            can be a powerful assistant, relying solely on AI-generated content without your own effort
                            and verification can lead to misunderstandings and academic integrity issues. Use Rubitt to
                            enhance your learning, not to replace it.</p>
                        <p class="section-text fs-16">By using Rubitt, you acknowledge and agree to these limitations.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('./partials/footer.ejs') %>